; don't cross >2000 boundary... got about 2k
; I should add some protection to this some day.

       BYTE 0
LEN    BYTE 0
FNAME  EQU  $
WORK   EQU  FNAME+50
PGETBL       EQU  WORK+100
FILEBUF      EQU  PGETBL+264
BIGBUF       EQU  FILEBUF+256   80char/line buffer (don't exceed 80*50=4k)
